Hi,

At 00:16 29.06.2011, Lukasz Rymanowski wrote:
>Hi Luiz,
>
>On Tue, Jun 28, 2011 at 11:48 PM, Luiz Augusto von Dentz
><luiz.dentz@gmail.com> wrote:
